 "conflict_resolution": {
  "07j": "Correct for the ACTIVE path only (HolyAuraMutator: defaults*2.0, tree copy not re-multiplied). Missing: (1+X) factor, the passive AuraMutator path, extras, durations.",
  "07h": "Correct (value * [k if useAuraStatsMultiplier] * (1+X)); flag is true for defaults and the mana regen/block/movespeed/stun extras, false for tree list, health regen and immunity. X comes from the display class (mgr.holyAuraIncreasedEffect + increasedEffectFromPassives); 07h only noted that +0x140 is not read inside the local function itself.",
  "07c": "Correct: node stat -> AuraMutator.statsToApply (x1) and x2 copy -> HolyAuraMutator.statsToApply. Open question resolved: both lists reach the same recipients (caster + allies in 20 m); passive uses list 1 continuously, active uses list 2 during the boost window.",
  "haiku_draft": "Mostly wrong/misleading: treats active buff as caster-only and passive as allies-only (both hit everyone, ignoreCreator=0); calls increasedEffectFromPassives a tree increased-aura-effect value (it is always 0; real X is mgr.holyAuraIncreasedEffect from passive Covenant of Light); misses the 4.0 s / 0.5 s timing, same-name replacement, extras, flame-burst personal buff."
 }
}